{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJ8T02DDWYXT6YAJK1","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJMX0Y6SZQWFDXTWHR","name_zh":"自然化身","name_en":"Nature's Avatar","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":9,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 9","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S，DF","casting_time":"1 迅捷動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的動物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/等級","saving_throw":"意志過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"通過接觸，你給予你的動物盟友自然的力量，耐力和速度。\n被影響的動物獲得攻擊檢定和傷害檢定上獲得+10 士氣加值和每等級 1d8 點 hp，加上\n加速術（玩家手冊 239 頁）的效果。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[761,761],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"35fb6341c8d999897767b0a0bd9ba7e62b2b67f09c920ecbfb5b853264a489b1","heading":"自然化身（Nature's Avatar）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJ70QC8QAP4DA96X74","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJQJZ2D539ADNDZTF1","name_zh":"自然平衡","name_en":"Nature's Balance","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"10 分鐘/等級","saving_throw":"強韌過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"觸碰著你的夥伴，你專注於想像著一道光從你的身體飛出進入他的。當你如此做時，生命\n的藍色光芒在你的胸口搖曳，從你的手臂進入他的形體，給予他部分你的力量。\n你在所選擇的力量，敏捷或體質上受到-4 減值，你的目標在相同的屬性上獲得同等的\n加值。你無法做豁免檢定以避免損失，但你的目標可以試圖做強韌豁免以避免獲得增值，如果\n需要的話。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[761,761],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"291adec59281dc47ab415b1c085d23cee46a6d1dc8305eeec878b2c8f94b46a5","heading":"自然平衡（Nature's Balance）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJ2C6KZVMFGEZCAKB2","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJV3E7Z2QH8XEEBNNM","name_zh":"自然之寵愛","name_en":"Nature's Favor","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美冒險","完美神力","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["完美冒險","完美神力","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美冒險","完美神力","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 2、巡林客 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S、DF","casting_time":"迅捷動作","range":"觸摸","target":"觸摸到的動物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘","saving_throw":"意志（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你輕輕摩擦動物的肋部，低聲將這個法術意識的最後一小部分說出。被觸摸的動物在將目\n光投向你的敵人之前瞥了你一眼，毛髮同樣豎了起來。\n你能給你所觸摸的動物每三個施法者等級+1 幸運攻擊檢定和傷害檢定（最高+5，完美\n神力最高+3）。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[761,762],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"af9b9e8bb3aee124c1bf16579094c7ef5785b11b7d6859d5ebdd67fe66ad1e2e","heading":"自然之寵愛（Nature's Favor）（萬法大全）（完美冒險）（完美神力）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJT9HS04HZD1YZ3NK7","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJWEE0H1ZHPF1B3JJH","name_zh":"自然純淨","name_en":"Nature's Purity","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["異怪書"],"explicit_sources":["異怪書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["異怪書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3 級","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"語言，姿勢","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"中距（100 尺+10 尺/每等級）","target":"","area":"","effect":"一條或多條射線","duration":"立刻","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"一個閃亮的綠色光泉從你的手中伸出。你可以將射線瞄準任何距離內的目標。如果你命\n中目標，射線將造成 1d6 點力場傷害。\n對不死生物和構裝生物，射線造成 2d8 力場傷害。\n對於異怪，射線造成 5d6 點傷害並且擁有 19-20 的重擊威脅範圍。被傷害殺死的異怪立\n刻變成一個刺鼻的惰性植物性物質。\n每比 5 級 高 出 4 級，你可以多創造一條射線（最多在 17 級時 達到 4 條）。射線可以指向\n同一或不同目標，但所有的目標必須相互在 30 尺內而且將同時射擊。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[762,762],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c16ead8d11edfdae4b9a0284f546e90cfd61d9458a2ad82be0099cd06ba95491","heading":"自然純淨（Nature's Purity ）（異怪書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJEEZ9YE90PAFC9GX9","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJGF8NRPK908CYHVT5","name_zh":"自然壁壘","name_en":"Nature's Rampart","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3，巡林客 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S，F","casting_time":"10 分鐘","range":"中距（100 尺+10 尺/等級）","target":"","area":"40 平方尺的構築物","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"否","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"隨著你的手臂的最後一次揮舞，你腳下的土地顫抖著土地的外形轉變為了新的形態。\n你塑造出自然的改變以作為堅固的防禦。通常該法術被準備都是在開闊的戶外區域例如山\n坡或是森林，但在巨大的天然洞穴中也可以形成極好的壁壘。人工建築或造物不受影響， 雖\n然自然壁壘可以被放置於兩個建築之間以填滿間隙或是放置于沒有鋪設石磚的道路上作為障\n礙物。法術的效果將根據地形而有所不同：\n開闊戶外場所：5 尺高 5 尺厚的土質壁壘或障礙物以 5 尺寬 5 尺深的淺溝為外周在其後\n一下子升了起來。在障礙物後的生物獲得掩蔽。步行的攻擊者必須先爬到溝裡然後攀爬 10\n尺以翻過障礙物的頂部（攀爬 DC 10）。\n崎嶇戶外場所或洞穴：鬆散的石塊，枯木以及作為填充的稠密荊棘在地基區域的周邊組合\n成了 5 尺高 2 尺厚的防禦牆壁。牆後的生物獲得掩蔽。\n沼澤或低窪場所：在諸如沼澤，泥塘，濕地或是苔原地帶，自然壁壘無法築起牆壁，反\n而會創造出一道充滿水 10 尺寬 5 尺深的壕溝。強行試圖跋涉通過壕溝的生物的速度將降至\n他們正常速度的 1/4（最低 5 尺）並且無法衝鋒或是奔跑。\n法器：一小塊上面雕刻著精細的微型城堡圖案的石英寶石，價值 100GP。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[762,763],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"5c7ec224497fbc17b504479d45eeabd4fc6c0784e6e2c3bfc123e3f1fc7f0727","heading":"自然壁壘（Nature's Rampart）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJBH8PDENWD1P7GQHE","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJQYYY3XT7YM0KTPG3","name_zh":"傾聽自然","name_en":"Naturewatch","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":0,"note":""},{"class":"巡林客","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 0，巡林客 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"S","casting_time":"1 標準時間","range":"30 尺","target":"","area":"錐形散射","effect":"","duration":"10 分/等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"否","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"用心傾聽，你探尋著這片區域中動植物的健康狀況。\n該法術類似於觀命術（玩家手冊 217 頁），但它僅對動植物起效。另外，它還可以讓你\n獲知一些有關動植物的普通資訊（植物是否脫水，動物是否缺乏營養，如此等等）。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[763,763],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"2fedd055a9317c62c99b0ceeabceadcac0486e40cb0ac936e89662e3b198fa5c","heading":"傾聽自然（Naturewatch）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJ4Y9EZNSGQJ2WBB96","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJAP6YAYFT9GV2AQQ4","name_zh":"自然怒意","name_en":"Nature’s Wrath","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["ECS"],"explicit_sources":["ECS"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["ECS"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"督依德","level":3,"note":"護門者"}],"level_text_raw":"督依德 3 級（護門者）","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"動作，語言","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"中程（100 尺+每等級 10 尺）","target":"20 尺半徑爆發範圍內的非自然生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即生效，1 輪，參閱說明","saving_throw":"意志部分，意志減半，參閱說明","spell_resistance":"有效","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"角色召喚自然的力量打擊目標。自然世界中的生物這道法術免疫；而變異體生物，亡靈，\n以及其他褻瀆自然的生物會受到傷害。這道法術可以傷害範圍內特定類型的生物。動物，構\n裝體，元素，妖精，元素亞種（氣，土，火，水）的異界生物，膠質怪，植物，毒蟲以及沒法\n活動的物體對這道法術免疫。變異體生物受到每施法者等級 1d6 點傷害（最高 10d6），\n並眩暈 1 輪。通過意志檢定的目標傷害減半，同時忽略眩暈效果。其他類型（龍類，巨人，\n類人生物，魔法動物，類人怪物，以及非元素亞種的異界生物）的生物受到每 2 施法者等\n級 1d8 點傷害（最高 5d8）。通過意志檢定的目標傷害減半。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[763,763],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3673154dfac6f61ca5c30d320eccbd6dfebb44cf93234fe930c05db357be205e","heading":"自然怒意（Nature’s Wrath）（ECS）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJAA7DEX4NBCP23AXE","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJ99M03QEC9VY5XT2Q","name_zh":"反胃吐息","name_en":"Nauseating Breath","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 3，術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"創造","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S，M","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"30 尺","target":"","area":"錐形爆發","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"強韌過則無效","spell_resistance":"否","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你像風車一樣旋轉手臂以完成該法術並在窒息前一刻將一大團腐臭的綠色氣體呼出。\n你噴吐出錐形的反胃氣體。在區域中的任何生物都必須成功通過強韌豁免否則會被反胃\n1d6 輪。\n施法材料：一片放置了至少一天的魚片。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[763,764],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"860e4e401a8300495ac4c31a9bbc1d5b9eb12efa889cac23afac3caa8754e27b","heading":"反胃吐息（Nauseating Breath）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFJBZM8H3ZM31HG73EP","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFJ6VQDZJ9JYZC0AJQT","name_zh":"近在天邊","name_en":"Near Horizon","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"刺客","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"遊俠","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"刺客 2,遊俠 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V, S","casting_time":"一個迅捷動作","range":"個人","target":"你自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"3 輪","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"在你超人的視力中地平線似乎突然接近你。\n你獲得了一種神秘的洞察能力看到大多數人都幾乎看不到的目標。在法術的持續時間\n裡，你在使用遠端武器時沒有距離處罰，但只限於武器的最大射程範圍內。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[764,764],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"27568baba851692cce837a26a761eb3213ad903c4417b3646a3bd80242b16a59","heading":"近在天邊（Near Horizon）（完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFK4CGN7D7DANTSZ02C","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFKF5JDR184F3PEMGEB","name_zh":"偵測腐囊","name_en":"Necrotic Awareness","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 1，術士/法師 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，器材","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"60 英尺","target":"","area":"錐狀彌散","effect":"","duration":"專注，最多 1 分鐘每等級（消解）","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你能感應到腐囊（見同名法術，在後面）感染體的存在。能感應到的信息量由他們在你\n的感應範圍內呆的時間的長度決定。\n第 1 輪：有這種攜帶者接近或離開\n第 2 輪：這些攜帶者的數量\n第 3 輪：每個攜帶者的位置。如果他處在你的視線外，你可以感應其方向，而非其具體位\n置\n施法器材：你必須擁有腐囊母體（見死者之書第 28 頁）","description_en":null,"source_pages":[764,764],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"ce2400c1f229200f29a60fe00d6ca8764b6dbd4f37c6560cb98d670f9af85749","heading":"偵測腐囊（Necrotic Awareness）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFK605BY7CY93X9Y77E","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFKCDSY3MWRGHYCSWGB","name_zh":"腐囊腫脹","name_en":"Necrotic Bloat","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 3，術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"言語，姿勢，器材","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"中","target":"腐囊感染體","area":"","effect":"","duration":"瞬間","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你使攜帶者身上的腐囊搏動並腫大。這一過程十分劇烈，將撕裂受害者的活體組織，擴\n大腐囊體積，造成極大的內部傷害。目標受到 1d6 每等級的傷害（最高 10d6），其中一半為\n穢惡傷害（見《崇惡 之書 》），因為腐囊將漲到包裹住新生的死靈化組織。穢惡傷害部分被治癒\n後，腐囊才會回復原體積。\n施法器材：你必須擁有腐囊母體","description_en":null,"source_pages":[764,765],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"a3f84f0fc985bb9f1c71865a51448aafa6c19637df510656c132824d75dcb5f1","heading":"腐囊腫脹（Necrotic Bloat）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFKWAEWTZ66T1RMWDGZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFKYCQTMRE4J1RKCXKV","name_zh":"腐囊爆裂","name_en":"Necrotic Burst","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":5,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 5，術士/法師 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"言語，姿勢，器材","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"中","target":"腐囊感染體","area":"","effect":"","duration":"瞬間","saving_throw":"堅韌部分","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你使感染體身上的腐囊吞齧其正常組織，並爆炸性增大體積。如果受害者通過堅韌檢定，\n將受到 1d6 每等級（最高 15d6）傷害，一半為穢惡傷害。由腐囊造成的對抗死靈系法術的\n豁免罰值也有效。\n如果檢定失敗，腐囊的生長將失去控制，直至殺死攜帶者。死亡的後一輪，腐囊將成為一\n個擁有自由意志的不死生物從受害者體內爬出。這種不死生物是鬼祟腐囊 （見本書 120\n面——後面有介紹）。\n法器：你必須擁有腐囊母體","description_en":null,"source_pages":[765,765],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"66e091e1560d3f12143899d4a6379a3c7b3eb506d129677697da0c308f8f81a3","heading":"腐囊爆裂（Necrotic Burst）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFKR9W3B78H1XFSBPSG","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFKF3ADMHNJ04KH05E4","name_zh":"壞死詛咒","name_en":"Necrotic Curse","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":7,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 7, 術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"V, S, M","casting_time":"一個整輪動作","range":"近距（25 英尺+5 英尺/2 等級）","target":"","area":"20 英尺半徑彌漫","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/每等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你感到通過你的觸摸一股寒氣滲入土地，空氣，甚至鄰近的靈魂。\n你灌輸進法術區域的負能量是如此強大以至於能把正能量轉化成負能量。任何在法術區\n域內施展治療法術的人必須通過成功一個施法檢定（DC11+你的施法者水準）;如果檢定失敗，\n治療法術造成每個受術者等於施法者等級的傷害而不是正常效果。\n在法術範圍內休息的活物不會恢復生命值或屬性點數。在法術範圍內的不死生物每 24\n小時回復 1 點生命值\n除了正常的持續時間結束法術外，這個法術效果可以用移除詛咒（Remove Curse）（或\n類似法術）來結束區域內的法術。\n施法材料：墓地塵土。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[765,765],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"4fd3f45c4b9fee1b82f4b10d3b5c0c290e7bda5afed33147abfe8a4d1cb1dbb4","heading":"壞死詛咒（Necrotic Curse）（完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFKVKCE1CSWJD3QB7PP","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFK96TD53M43HR1DMRZ","name_zh":"腐敗囊腫","name_en":"Necrotic Cyst","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 2，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"言語，姿勢，器材","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"被觸活體生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"瞬間","saving_throw":"堅韌無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"目標體內長出球狀囊腫，內包著液態或半液態的死靈機質。它看起來像一個（長在被你\n接觸到的部位的）輕微腫起，有時會非常的深，以至於腫起都沒有，讓受害者完全無法察覺。從\n此之後，不死生物和死靈系法術對於受害者將變得更為致命——腐囊可以與外界的死\n靈力量發生互動。當攜帶者受到死靈法術或效果的影響時，他對抗的豁免將受到-2 罰值。\n當攜帶者被不死生物的天然武器擊中時，將受到 1d6 的額外傷害。\n攜帶者可以找到善意的外科大夫通過手術移除它。這是個血腥的、痛苦的過程。手術通\n過 DC20 的醫療檢定成功後，受術者將在一個小時內無法動彈；如果手術失敗，受害者將悲慘\n的死去。手術需要進行一個小時，且不能取 20。\n“防護邪惡”或類似法術能阻止腐囊的形成。一旦形成後，“防護邪惡”將再也無法阻\n止它那些能與它互動的法術效果。\n施法器材：你必須擁有腐囊母體","description_en":null,"source_pages":[765,766],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"b1967c5a0f9574994108411f0e0950df27a2b8ce944d2a90f7c5c8a52b3b61ac","heading":"腐敗囊腫（Necrotic Cyst）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
