{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFKVHRX4KTMR24HPKDB","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFKMKWXH4W5E77H9HJ4","name_zh":"腐囊強化","name_en":"Necrotic Empowerment","alphabet":"N","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":8,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":8,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 8，術士/法師 8","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"言語，姿勢，器材","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"個人","target":"自身","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你呼喚體內的腐囊母體，從它那裡獲得力量、精力、速度、及堅定的邪惡意志。法術時效\n內，你的敏捷、智力及感知獲得+8 的增強加值；你的皮膚明顯變粗變硬，使天然裝甲+8； 你\n的堅韌豁免獲得+5 環境加值，同時獲得 100 點 臨 時 hp。\n法術時效內，你不能施放其它使用腐囊母體力量的法術了。\n施法器材：你必須擁有腐囊母體","description_en":null,"source_pages":[766,766],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"a2e72108a68d69b57a8cd0233e0f0324a5352e1bb7c7d99da17e07b303aca7f0","heading":"腐囊強化（Necrotic Empowerment）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
